## 5. Roadmap解锁

### 入口
📄 **文件**: [`sections/view-roadmap.html`](./sections/view-roadmap.html)
📄 **详细页面**: [`roadmap/roadmap.html`](./roadmap/roadmap.html)

### 功能
- 🗺️ 根据学生阶段解锁不同Roadmap
- 📊 阶段可视化
- ✅ 任务跟踪

### Roadmap阶段
根据学生当前阶段，解锁对应的Roadmap:

1. **Pre-High School** (高中前)
   - 📄 [`roadmap/roadmap_pre_high_school.html`](./roadmap/roadmap_pre_high_school.html)

2. **Building Candidacy** (建立候选资格)
   - 📄 [`roadmap/roadmap_building_candidacy.html`](./roadmap/roadmap_building_candidacy.html)

3. **Application** (申请阶段)
   - 📄 [`roadmap/roadmap_application.html`](./roadmap/roadmap_application.html)

4. **Post-Application** (申请后)
   - 📄 [`roadmap/roadmap_post_application.html`](./roadmap/roadmap_post_application.html)

### 流程
```
[Profile完成度达到阈值]
    ↓
[根据学生阶段判断]
    ├─→ Pre-High School
    ├─→ Building Candidacy
    ├─→ Application
    └─→ Post-Application
        ↓
[解锁对应Roadmap]
        ↓
[展示阶段Roadmap]
        ↓
[查看可解锁的Missions]
```

