## 8. Router日常交互

### 入口
📄 **主要文件**: [`router/router.html`](./router/router.html)

### 功能
- 🌅 每日暖场交互
- 🧭 智能路由引导
- 📊 状态仪表板
- 🔍 审查功能

### Router页面 (根据学生阶段)

1. **Pre-High School Router**
   - 📄 [`router/router_pre_high_school.html`](./router/router_pre_high_school.html)

2. **Building Candidacy Router**
   - 📄 [`router/router_building_candidacy.html`](./router/router_building_candidacy.html)

3. **Application Router**
   - 📄 [`router/router_application.html`](./router/router_application.html)

4. **Post-Application Router**
   - 📄 [`router/router_post_application.html`](./router/router_post_application.html)

5. **Review Router**
   - 📄 [`router/router_review.html`](./router/router_review.html)

6. **Status Dashboard**
   - 📄 [`router/router_status_dashboard.html`](./router/router_status_dashboard.html)

### 流程
```
[用户每日登录]
    ↓
[进入Router页面]
    ↓
[AI Tutor暖场交互]
    ├─→ 问候
    ├─→ 检查上次进度
    └─→ 提供建议
        ↓
[Router智能分析]
    ├─→ 检查Profile完整度
    ├─→ 检查任务进度
    ├─→ 检查截止日期
    └─→ 生成建议
        ↓
[引导用户]
    ├─→ 完善Profile
    │   └─→ 跳转到 view-profile.html
    ├─→ 查看Roadmap
    │   └─→ 跳转到 view-roadmap.html
    ├─→ 执行Mission任务
    │   ├─→ Capstone
    │   ├─→ Major Advisor
    │   └─→ Academic
    ├─→ 查看Persona
    │   └─→ 跳转到 view-persona.html
    └─→ 更多交互行为
        ↓
[根据Router规则导航]
```

